1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,033
This week: the thing everyone presses.

2
00:00:04,267 --> 00:00:08,667
Great order. Lovely total. Now, how does
anyone pay?

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:14,433
Import it, wrap your label, pass an
onPress. That's the whole setup.

4
00:00:15,667 --> 00:00:18,967
Color, height and press feedback: already
decided for you.

5
00:00:21,367 --> 00:00:25,800
Tap it: isLoading drops in a spinner and
ignores the nervous double tap.

6
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:32,233
Primary shouts, ghost whispers, danger
means it. Same prop, different volume.

7
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:38,233
Swap the variant and only the tokens
change. No new component, no restyling.

8
00:00:39,467 --> 00:00:42,333
Four sizes move height, padding, radius
and type.

9
00:00:43,567 --> 00:00:47,767
Width stays yours: it fills a column and
hugs a row.

10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,567
Slots render in JSX order: the icon sits
where you put it.

11
00:00:55,467 --> 00:00:59,467
Add to cart: the spinner slides in, and
the button doesn't jump.

12
00:01:00,667 --> 00:01:04,167
Pass one hex; the variant decides where it
lands.

13
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:10,833
Soft and pressed shades are derived in
OKLab. No palette meetings.

14
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:16,533
Flip the system to dark. Same code, and
the tokens follow.

15
00:01:18,033 --> 00:01:21,300
Screen readers hear a button, and hear
when it's busy.

16
00:01:22,533 --> 00:01:26,233
Docs at ui.xtartapp.com.
